  C("How would a Platonist respond to the six direct arguments?", ["Reject them all as question-begging", "Accept only the argument from science", "Take them to prove God’s existence", "Accept them, since they establish realism without settling where abstract objects exist"], 3, "The direct arguments establish realism. The Platonist agrees; the disagreement comes at steps 6–15.", "understand")
